        "review_title": "Durable and Reliable Landscape Wire",
        "rating": 5,
        "review_text": "I purchased the SUNVIE 100FT 16/2 Low Voltage Landscape Wire for a backyard lighting project, and it worked perfectly. The wire is high-quality, with a durable insulation that feels tough enough to handle outdoor elements.The 16/2 gauge is ideal for low-voltage applications like landscape lighting, and it was easy to work with during installation. Cutting and stripping the wire was straightforward, and it connected securely to my lights and transformer without any issues.The 100-foot length provided plenty of coverage for my project, with some wire to spare. It’s flexible enough to lay neatly along pathways and around corners, but sturdy enough to stay in place once positioned.If you’re looking for reliable, easy-to-use low-voltage wire for your landscape lighting, this is a solid choice. It held up well during installation and has been working flawlessly with no issues so far. Definitely recommend for DIYers and anyone upgrading their outdoor lighting setup.\nRead more",
